doc:Predictive_Maintenance_Article schema:abstract "This study proposes an IPSO-SVM-based fault prediction and fuzzy speed control system for unmanned combine harvesters. The system integrates multi-component slip rate data and uses the IPSO-SVM model for fault warning. The fuzzy control algorithm adjusts operating speed based on predicted fault status and feeding rate to mitigate clogging risks." .
